# The moss at noon: its fen from above at the play camera and wider, close on its
# most characteristic ground, over the shoulder, and a stone standing in it close
# (BogFen, world.gdshader bog_floor; a stone's moss cap is BiomeDressing.mossy), and
# from above again at dusk.
#   tools/tour.sh tours/moss-ground.tour --seed=1 --weather=clear:0
coast calm
hour 12
place moss
await top_view 4
wait 2.0
shot 01-the-moss-from-above with land:moss
zoom 30
wait 1.5
shot 02-the-moss-from-higher with land:moss
zoom 15
place typical_moss
wait 1.5
zoom 7
wait 1.0
shot 03-close-on-the-moss with land:moss
zoom 15
wait 0.6
hold shoulder_peek
await shoulder 5
wait 1.0
shot 04-the-moss-over-the-shoulder with shoulder,land:moss
release shoulder_peek
place moss
near boulder
wait 1.5
zoom 6
wait 1.0
shot 05-a-stone-in-the-moss with land:moss
zoom 15
hour 18.5
place moss
await top_view 4
wait 2.0
shot 06-the-moss-from-above-at-dusk with land:moss
